  "certificate_scope": {
    "method": "analysis_code_blobs is the static import closure (ast; module-level and function-local import statements, relative and absolute) of the roots, restricted to modules that resolve to a file under harness/ or scripts/. Nothing in the map is listed by hand. Values are Git SHA-1 blob identities: sha1('blob ' + len + NUL + bytes) over the file with CRLF normalised to LF, recomputable with `git hash-object -- <path>` at the anchoring commit.",
